Done. Added `filterByTags` to `src/bookmarks.ts`:

```ts
export function filterByTags(bookmarks: Bookmark[], tags: string[]): Bookmark[] {
  if (tags.length === 0) return bookmarks;
  return bookmarks.filter((b) => tags.every((tag) => b.tags.includes(tag)));
}
```

- Empty `tags` → returns all bookmarks (short-circuit).
- Non-empty `tags` → AND semantics: a bookmark must contain every tag in the array.
- `deno check` passes.


